    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure Jay M Margolis, Nicole Princic, and David M Smith are employees of Truven Health Analytics, which was paid by Pfizer Inc in connection with the research and development of this manuscript. Lucy Abraham, Joseph C Cappelleri, Sonali N Shah, and Peter W Park are employees and shareholders of Pfizer Inc. The authors report no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
